/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 155 0 R
/T (counter\(\) call hua. Stack mein iska execution context bana, jahan count = 0 hai. counter\(\) ne inner function return kiya aur stack se pop off \(delete\) ho gaya. Normal rule ke mutabik count variable ko memory se delete ho jana chahiye tha. Lekin V8 engine ne dekha ki jo function return hua hai, wo count ko use kar raha hai. Engine ne count ko garbage collect nahi kiya, balki use Heap Memory mein zinda rakha. Ab jab tum inc\(\) ko call karte ho, toh wo har baar usi purane saved count variable ko access karta hai aur use increment karta hai \(1, 2, 3\))
/E (counter\(\) call hua. Stack mein iska execution context bana, jahan count = 0 hai. counter\(\) ne inner function return kiya aur stack se pop off \(delete\) ho gaya. Normal rule ke mutabik count variable ko memory se delete ho jana chahiye tha. Lekin V8 engine ne dekha ki jo function return hua hai, wo count ko use kar raha hai. Engine ne count ko garbage collect nahi kiya, balki use Heap Memory mein zinda rakha. Ab jab tum inc\(\) ko call karte ho, toh wo har baar usi purane saved count variable ko access karta hai aur use increment karta hai \(1, 2, 3\))
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
